      "id": "claim_43f5f214bfd64eabb5ac8d4b69f8cc47",
      "statement": "The Agent Server image is built from the uv workspace and lockfile: langgraph.json sets source.kind to uv with root '.' and package langchain-chess-server, Python 3.13 on the wolfi distro, graph chess from apps/server graph.py:make_graph and http.app from apps/server app.py:app.",
