      "statement": "Because langgraph-cli 0.4.31 copies only the root pyproject.toml before uv export, langgraph.json dockerfile_lines ADDs each workspace member's pyproject.toml (libs/chess, libs/systemone, libs/cli, apps/server) into /tmp/uv_export/project, and that list must stay in step with the root workspace members.",
