      "id": "claim_05b48146eb514c669636d704ac48a286",
      "statement": "ServerSettings reads the shell then .env and rejects LANGSMITH_GATEWAY_API_KEY, TYPESAFE_API_KEY or TYPESAFE_BASE_URL when set but blank; make_graph constructs ServerSettings per run, so an empty value written into the deployment .env fails runs rather than falling back silently.",
