    {
      "id": "claim_e0505093f18a4c15ad1f1e4bc3e2933f",
      "statement": "The first job of each deploy workflow, tip, runs inside the concurrency lock and resolves the current main commit via the GitHub API rather than using the pushed SHA, so a retried or long-queued older run ships main as it is now, and CI and the deploy checkout both use that SHA.",
