    {
      "id": "claim_e080b614dcda4474bd3eb72e66c1da2b",
      "statement": "Replacing a pending older run in a deploy concurrency group is safe only because every run of that workflow deploys the same target, which is why the review app lives in its own workflow and group instead of sharing the agent's.",
